  "details": "A vulnerability has been found in Lybbn Django-Vue-Lyadmin up to 3.2.12. The impacted element is an unknown function of the file backend/application/settings.py of the component JWT Signing. The manipulation of the argument SECRET_KEY leads to use of hard-coded cryptographic key\n . Remote exploitation of the attack is possible. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The project maintainer explains: \"The issue with this key is described in the documentation. Developers need to manually change their keys before deployment.\"",
